  "differences_from_v2_1b": [
    "Chicago Fed NFCI replaced with Federal Reserve Board FCI-G.",
    "St. Louis Fed Financial Stress Index replaced with OFR Financial Stress Index.",
    "FCI-G introduces a monthly financial-conditions channel, increasing persistence and requiring explicit stale-age controls.",
    "OFR FSI is daily and broader/global in scope than STLFSI4."
